    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">RMC301 · Chapter 17 · Session 51 · assessment / review</span>\n<h2>Session 51 — Chapter 17: Writing Research Reports. Use AI to summarize research papers and develop literature review</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13395 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">RMC301 · Chương 17 · Buổi 51 · kiểm tra / ôn tập</span>\n<h2>Buổi 51 — Chapter 17: Writing Research Reports. Use AI to summarize research papers and develop literature review</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13395 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">ITU</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">ITU</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Chapter 17: Writing Research Reports. Use AI to summarize research papers and develop literature review</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Textbook<br>PPT Slides</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>- Participate in class's activities: asks questions, answer questions<br>- Read the syllabus<br>- Read main textbook<br>- Follow lecturer's guidance of using AI<br>- Before using AI, students should:<br>+ Understand thoroughly their research problem and questions;<br>+ Learn how to write effective prompts;<br>+ Critically evaluate AI-generated ideas;<br>+ Note any constraints during AI use.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
